+# Finite eleven fixture adaptations
+
+## 功能概述
+
+This isolated increment starts from exact tree 493bc21d041a96cd9d3a8037e72f6c6454e1df7b (1874 tracked files). Its actual84 strict failure and the earlier fd367 whole300 failure remain immutable. This spec supersedes only the prior finite-fixture-canonical-repair FR-3 complete-body requirement for the terminal-UNKNOWN negative POST case; it does not revise either historical result or any positive body requirement.
+
+## 需求列表
+
+## FR-1 — Eight exact readonly reseal adaptations
+
+Only the following existing methods SHALL replace obsolete actual-client selection setters with trusted fresh-actual-client resealing. Original changed inputs, metadata endpoints and request counts, deadlines, error/effect assertions and owner cleanup SHALL remain. IntegrationTLS SHALL use its existing adopt_selection/seal helpers. ArtifactTLS tests SHALL close the previous actual third-tuple client, adopt a fresh actual client's canonical selection and close every newly held actual client in fixture cleanup. The f.api BudgetAPI object SHALL remain data; neither value equality nor data SHALL become a credential, owner or grant.
+
+| Class | Exact methods |
+|---|---|
+| AdmissionCases | test_event_ref_and_pr_merge_selection_rejected; test_gate_digest_canonical_order_and_binding; test_paginated_newest_run_selection_has_exact_inventory |
+| ArtifactAdmissionCases | test_all_three_frozen_artifact_digest_mismatches_block; test_raw_npm_rustsec_glib_and_installed_contract_failures_stay_failures |
+| FinalAdmissionCases | test_both_canonical_digests_and_incidental_metadata; test_complete_paginated_final_selection; test_distinct_supported_integration_ref_and_final_branch |
+
+## FR-2 — Two exact Foreign constructor negatives
+
+AdmissionCases.test_caller_claims_and_reports_cannot_bypass_fixed_authentication and FinalAdmissionCases.test_fresh_reobservation_and_caller_claims_confer_no_authority SHALL retain the original Foreign subclass input and attempted authentication expression. The actual credential constructor SHALL reject it with invalid_request/none before new requests or owner creation. The tests SHALL explicitly observe zero additional requests and no session owner on the unchanged actual client. Remaining caller GET override, forged report/selection, extraneous approval/roles/report kwargs and fresh reobservation negatives SHALL remain. Forged report data SHALL be passed as fixture selection input to the unchanged actual client without assigning its readonly production selection. No __new__, fake credential or fallback SHALL be introduced.
+
+## FR-3 — Terminal UNKNOWN POST contract
+
+OwnedRequestCases.test_post_dispatch_stream_drift_is_terminal_unknown_no_retry SHALL retain its original altered stream and uncertain_remote_effect, rerun hard rejection, both original exact server count-equals-two assertions, actual operation IDs 2/5 and kinds CreateDraft/UploadAsset, immutable snapshot/session/client/credential/scope bindings, consumed/attempted and retired scopes, zero additional successful request headers after rerun, and actual server thread death after the existing close/join(3). Both complete server header records SHALL match the actual native snapshot method/path/header dictionaries in private memory. No wait, deadline or retry SHALL be added. Complete-body differences SHALL be separately printed as bounded diagnostic UNPROVEN; successful sendall or saved header rows SHALL confer no complete-body, asset or release completion evidence.
+
+## FR-4 — Positive and finite-source invariants
+
+OwnedRequestCases.test_native_owned_loopback_exact_bytes_and_one_attempt_each SHALL keep its original AST and strict full six-payload/hash/body/cleanup assertions and SHALL execute on the new frozen source. The complete tracked Python test inventory SHALL use full path, lexical scope and occurrence identifiers, and permit exactly the eleven named existing method AST changes relative to 493bc. All other existing methods, all production bytes, three hard rejects, PR98 cancellation, snapshot suspension, unknown gates and native issuers SHALL remain unchanged. The other eight methods in NEXT-FINITE18-SOURCE-TRACE-MAPPING remain outside authorization.
+
+## FR-5 — Fresh bounded qualification
+
+Fresh exact-source upstream impacts SHALL precede edits, including ArtifactAdmissionCases.fixture HIGH21 direct/1flow. The new delegated Plan, complete source/index/runtime/runner/retained fixture freeze, explicit unique loader inventory and raw receipt SHALL remain auditable. Necessary tests SHALL include the positive exact-bytes method and the prior actual84 inventory without filtering its remaining failures. A new final whole300 is still required after all necessary corrections; no 18/267/300/84 component result may be borrowed or relabeled.
+
+## 非功能需求
+
+Only trusted test helpers, the eleven listed test methods and this spec triplet change. No production setters, manual scopes, foreign-owner absorption, grants, retry, time-budget enlargement, arbitrary wait or remote write. Bounded diagnostics contain no raw headers/body/tokens or credential hashes. A saved empty body row does not prove zero socket bytes received.
+
+## 依赖关系
+
+AGENTS, probe 4.0.1, exact 493bc upstream graph and actual84 raw traces; actual immutable GitHub credential/canonical Selection, original HTTPSFixture and original native session loop. Prior source-specific failures are diagnosis inputs, never new-source PASS evidence.
